{
 "lessonId": "lesson-20-events-p1",
 "allow": [
  "html",
  "css",
  "js"
 ],
 "topic": {
  "ru": "События: click, input, наведение",
  "uz": "Hodisalar: click, input, olib borish",
  "en": "Events: click, input, hover"
 },
 "sections": {
  "0": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Счётчик кликов",
    "uz": "Bosishlar hisoblagichi",
    "en": "Click counter"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Каждый клик прибавляет 1.",
    "uz": "Har bir bosish 1 qo'shadi.",
    "en": "Every click adds 1."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <button class=\"btn\">Нажми</button>\n  <p class=\"count\">Нажали: 0</p>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "let\\s+count\\s*=\\s*0",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`let count = 0;` — число будет меняться",
      "uz": "`let count = 0;` — son o'zgaradi",
      "en": "`let count = 0;` — the number will change"
     },
     "show": "let count = 0;"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "addEventListener\\(\\s*[\"\\']click[\"\\']\\s*,",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Слушай клик: `btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () { … });`",
      "uz": "Bosishni tingla: `btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () { … });`",
      "en": "Listen for a click: `btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () { … });`"
     },
     "show": "const btn = document.querySelector(\".btn\");\nconst counter = document.querySelector(\".count\");\nbtn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n\n});"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "count\\s*(\\+\\+|\\+=\\s*1|=\\s*count\\s*\\+\\s*1)[\\s\\S]*textContent",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Внутри: `count = count + 1;` и покажи `counter.textContent = \"Нажали: \" + count;`",
      "uz": "Ichida: `count = count + 1;` va ko'rsat `counter.textContent = \"Bosildi: \" + count;`",
      "en": "Inside: `count = count + 1;` and show `counter.textContent = \"Clicks: \" + count;`"
     },
     "show": "count = count + 1;\ncounter.textContent = \"Нажали: \" + count;"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  },
  "1": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Кнопка подписки",
    "uz": "Obuna tugmasi",
    "en": "Subscribe button"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Как на YouTube: переключаем класс.",
    "uz": "YouTube dagidek: klassni almashtiramiz.",
    "en": "Like on YouTube: we toggle a class."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <button class=\"sub-btn\">Подписаться</button>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": ".subscribed {\n  background: #ccc;\n}\n",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "classList\\.toggle\\(\\s*[\"\\']subscribed[\"\\']\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`subBtn.classList.toggle(\"subscribed\");` по клику",
      "uz": "Bosilganda `subBtn.classList.toggle(\"subscribed\");`",
      "en": "`subBtn.classList.toggle(\"subscribed\");` on click"
     },
     "show": "const subBtn = document.querySelector(\".sub-btn\");\nsubBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  subBtn.classList.toggle(\"subscribed\");\n});"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "if\\s*\\(\\s*\\w+\\.classList\\.contains\\(\\s*[\"\\']subscribed[\"\\']\\s*\\)\\s*\\)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Меняй текст: `if (subBtn.classList.contains(\"subscribed\")) { … } else { … }`",
      "uz": "Matnni almashtir: `if (subBtn.classList.contains(\"subscribed\")) { … } else { … }`",
      "en": "Change the text: `if (subBtn.classList.contains(\"subscribed\")) { … } else { … }`"
     },
     "show": "if (subBtn.classList.contains(\"subscribed\")) {\n  subBtn.textContent = \"Вы подписаны\";\n} else {\n  subBtn.textContent = \"Подписаться\";\n}"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  },
  "2": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Событие input",
    "uz": "input hodisasi",
    "en": "The input event"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Текст из поля сразу на странице.",
    "uz": "Maydondagi matn darhol sahifada.",
    "en": "The field text appears on the page right away."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <input class=\"name\" placeholder=\"Твоё имя\">\n  <h2 class=\"hello\"></h2>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "addEventListener\\(\\s*[\"\\']input[\"\\']",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Слушай `\"input\"` у поля",
      "uz": "Maydonda `\"input\"` ni tingla",
      "en": "Listen for `\"input\"` on the field"
     },
     "show": "const input = document.querySelector(\".name\");\nconst hello = document.querySelector(\".hello\");\ninput.addEventListener(\"input\", function () {\n\n});"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "textContent\\s*=\\s*[^;\\n]*\\.value",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Внутри: `hello.textContent = input.value;`",
      "uz": "Ichida: `hello.textContent = input.value;`",
      "en": "Inside: `hello.textContent = input.value;`"
     },
     "show": "hello.textContent = input.value;"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  },
  "4": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "e.target",
    "uz": "e.target",
    "en": "e.target"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Кнопки цветов перекрасят страницу.",
    "uz": "Rang tugmalari sahifani bo'yaydi.",
    "en": "Color buttons repaint the page."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"colors\">\n    <button>tomato</button>\n    <button>gold</button>\n    <button>skyblue</button>\n  </div>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": "",
    "script.js": ""
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "querySelectorAll\\(\\s*[\"\\']\\.colors button[\"\\']\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]*forEach",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Найди все кнопки и пройди по ним `forEach`",
      "uz": "Barcha tugmalarni top va `forEach` bilan o't",
      "en": "Find all buttons and go through them with `forEach`"
     },
     "show": "const buttons = document.querySelectorAll(\".colors button\");\nbuttons.forEach(function (btn) {\n\n});"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "function\\s*\\(\\s*e\\s*\\)|\\(\\s*e\\s*\\)\\s*=>",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Обработчик принимает `e`: `function (e) { … }`",
      "uz": "Ishlovchi `e` ni oladi: `function (e) { … }`",
      "en": "The handler takes `e`: `function (e) { … }`"
     },
     "show": "btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n\n});"
    },
    {
     "file": "script.js",
     "re": "document\\.body\\.style\\.(backgroundColor|background)\\s*=\\s*e\\.target\\.textContent",
     "say": {
      "ru": "`document.body.style.backgroundColor = e.target.textContent;`",
      "uz": "`document.body.style.backgroundColor = e.target.textContent;`",
      "en": "`document.body.style.backgroundColor = e.target.textContent;`"
     },
     "show": "document.body.style.backgroundColor = e.target.textContent;"
    }
   ],
   "open": "script.js"
  }
 },
 "homework": {
  "title": {
   "ru": "Кнопка лайка",
   "uz": "Layk tugmasi",
   "en": "Like button"
  },
  "intro": {
   "ru": "Как в Instagram: 🤍 0 → клик → ❤️ 1 и красная → клик → 🤍 0. Цвет — через класс в CSS.",
   "uz": "Instagram dagidek: 🤍 0 → bosish → ❤️ 1 va qizil → bosish → 🤍 0. Rang — CSS dagi klass orqali.",
   "en": "Like on Instagram: 🤍 0 → click → ❤️ 1 and red → click → 🤍 0. The color comes from a CSS class."
  },
  "files": {
   "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>JS</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"post\">\n    <div class=\"post-img\">🌄</div>\n    <button class=\"like-btn\">🤍 0</button>\n  </div>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
   "style.css": "",
   "script.js": ""
  },
  "steps": [
   {
    "file": "style.css",
    "re": "\\.liked\\s*\\{[^}]*(background|color)",
    "say": {
     "ru": "В CSS класс `.liked` с красным цветом",
     "uz": "CSS da qizil rangli `.liked` klassi",
     "en": "In CSS a `.liked` class with red"
    },
    "show": ".liked {\n  background: #ffdddd;\n  color: red;\n}"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "let\\s+likes\\s*=\\s*0",
    "say": {
     "ru": "`let likes = 0;`",
     "uz": "`let likes = 0;`",
     "en": "`let likes = 0;`"
    },
    "show": "const likeBtn = document.querySelector(\".like-btn\");\nlet likes = 0;"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "classList\\.toggle\\(\\s*[\"\\']liked[\"\\']\\s*\\)",
    "say": {
     "ru": "По клику `likeBtn.classList.toggle(\"liked\");`",
     "uz": "Bosilganda `likeBtn.classList.toggle(\"liked\");`",
     "en": "On click `likeBtn.classList.toggle(\"liked\");`"
    },
    "show": "likeBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n  likeBtn.classList.toggle(\"liked\");\n});"
   },
   {
    "file": "script.js",
    "re": "classList\\.contains\\(\\s*[\"\\']liked[\"\\']\\s*\\)[\\s\\S]*likes\\s*(\\+\\+|\\+=\\s*1|=\\s*likes\\s*\\+\\s*1)[\\s\\S]*likes\\s*(--|-=\\s*1|=\\s*likes\\s*-\\s*1)",
    "say": {
     "ru": "Есть класс — `likes + 1` и ❤️, нет — `likes - 1` и 🤍",
     "uz": "Klass bor — `likes + 1` va ❤️, yo'q — `likes - 1` va 🤍",
     "en": "Has the class — `likes + 1` and ❤️, not — `likes - 1` and 🤍"
    },
    "show": "if (likeBtn.classList.contains(\"liked\")) {\n  likes = likes + 1;\n  likeBtn.textContent = `❤️ ${likes}`;\n} else {\n  likes = likes - 1;\n  likeBtn.textContent = `🤍 ${likes}`;\n}"
   }
  ],
  "open": "script.js"
 }
}
